  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd46f4c48ea13f644b49af6b289fdb82, type: 3}
  m_Name: Begin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequence:
  - text: The sound of waves crashing against the shore can be heard from afar. $$The
      warm and gentle sunlight shines down over Rika and Maya, $$who are sitting
      beside each other.
    displayText: The sound of waves crashing against the shore can be heard from
      afar. The warm and gentle sunlight shines down over Rika and Maya, who are
      sitting beside each other.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 46000000460000008300000083000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 2
      parameter:
      - beach
    - index: 20
      functionType: 6
      parameter:
      - Room6BG Beach
      - 2
    - index: 20
      functionType: 4
      parameter:
      - Room6BG Beach
  - text: Rika has never been to a beach before. $$It's neither because she can't
      afford it, $$nor because of her parents' lack of time. $$Even if she found
      herself standing over the seaside, $$she would never dare to look at it.
    displayText: Rika has never been to a beach before. It's neither because she
      can't afford it, nor because of her parents' lack of time. Even if she found
      herself standing over the seaside, she would never dare to look at it.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 270000002700000051000000510000007b0000007b000000b0000000b0000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: It's just so.$.$.peaceful.
    displayText: It's just so...peaceful.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0d0000000e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.
    displayText: ...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika.
    displayText: Rika.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yes.
    displayText: Yes.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: We've been through so much, $$Rika. $$Anyone would break if they are in
      the same situation as ours.
    displayText: We've been through so much, Rika. Anyone would break if they are
      in the same situation as ours.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1c0000001c0000002200000022000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I know.
    displayText: I know.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 098a4f2cb9f2e2646b1a6906da2c3558, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: This world is the place between dream and death. $$It's the boundary between
      existing and not existing.
    displayText: This world is the place between dream and death. It's the boundary
      between existing and not existing.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3100000031000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You've heard this many times, $$but people always say life flashes before
      their eyes when they die.
    displayText: You've heard this many times, but people always say life flashes
      before their eyes when they die.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6ba46ecacc866544da47236fc876b59f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1e0000001e000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But what these people see is just a retrospective memory.
    displayText: But what these people see is just a retrospective memory.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1899c048cbc3cbf46ad8477960b7a91e, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: What do you mean?
    displayText: What do you mean?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika, $$people's lives are long. $$You cannot compress it all into one
      second like what those people see.
    displayText: Rika, people's lives are long. You cannot compress it all into one
      second like what those people see.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 06000000060000001f0000001f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: What you get is this long and painful journey across everything you've
      experienced. $$By yourself. $$Alone.
    displayText: What you get is this long and painful journey across everything
      you've experienced. By yourself. Alone.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 54000000540000006100000061000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: But I have you here too.$.$.?
    displayText: But I have you here too...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1800000019000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: That's because I am a part of you, $$Rika
    displayText: That's because I am a part of you, Rika
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2300000023000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya patted Rika's head and smiled. $$Her smile is more sad now.
    displayText: Maya patted Rika's head and smiled. Her smile is more sad now.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2400000024000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: B-But I don't really understand you.$.$.And if I don't understand you,
      $$then we aren't really the same person.$.$.$?
    displayText: B-But I don't really understand you...And if I don't understand
      you, then we aren't really the same person...?
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e23284570d4398b45acdfcf5a62324b6, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 240000002500000045000000450000006b0000006c0000006d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yes. $$You don't understand me. $$I am the part of you you chose to deny.
      $$I am the part of you you chose to not understand.
    displayText: Yes. You don't understand me. I am the part of you you chose to
      deny. I am the part of you you chose to not understand.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ec1ce6e63321a941829a1566caac4f2, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 05000000050000001e0000001e0000004600000046000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: I.$.$. $$I denied a part of myself.$.$.
    displayText: I... I denied a part of myself...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fe9e64057009084a9c5653faca90639, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 020000000300000005000000050000001f00000020000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: That's fine. $$I even try to deny myself as much as I can, $$just like
      you.
    displayText: That's fine. I even try to deny myself as much as I can, just like
      you.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0d0000000d0000003900000039000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: You see, $$the reason why I tried my best to act like I don't know anything,
      $$is so I can spend time with you without that huge burden.$.$.
    displayText: You see, the reason why I tried my best to act like I don't know
      anything, is so I can spend time with you without that huge burden...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 72c3981eaae6be5468be6dc68fac3515, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 09000000090000004b0000004b0000008400000085000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Despite knowing that eventually, $$it would hurt you at the end.$.$. $$I'm
      sorry too.$.$.
    displayText: Despite knowing that eventually, it would hurt you at the end...
      I'm sorry too...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 21000000210000003e0000003f00000041000000410000004f00000050000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 50
      functionType: 7
      parameter:
      - Room6BG Beach
      - 2
    - index: 0
      functionType: 3
      parameter:
      - beach
  - text: Maya stood up, $$spread her hands out, $$and turned toward Rika.
    displayText: Maya stood up, spread her hands out, and turned toward Rika.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
