  - text: This world is the place between dream and death. $$You chose death in the
      real world, $$but that decision is without the full context.
    displayText: This world is the place between dream and death. You chose death
      in the real world, but that decision is without the full context.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1899c048cbc3cbf46ad8477960b7a91e, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 31000000310000005400000054000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: This place can give you the choice to either live again, $$or die as your
      whole self.
    displayText: This place can give you the choice to either live again, or die
      as your whole self.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 3900000039000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The sound of waves stopped. $$The sunlight slowly dimmed away. $$The air
      turns colder. $$And the wall of simulation shattered into pieces.
    displayText: The sound of waves stopped. The sunlight slowly dimmed away. The
      air turns colder. And the wall of simulation shattered into pieces.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1c0000001c0000003d0000003d0000005300000053000000
    functionCalls:
    - index: 0
      functionType: 2
      parameter:
      - HorrorGJ4
  - text: The room materializes as a surreal landscape. Each fragment broken from
      the wall turns into crystal shards floating in the air, $$reflecting each moment
      of Rika's life.
    displayText: The room materializes as a surreal landscape. Each fragment broken
      from the wall turns into crystal shards floating in the air, reflecting each
      moment of Rika's life.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 8000000080000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Everything exists simultaneously, $$and the past, $$present, $$and future
      are all visible at the same time, $$flickering like a corrupted save file.
    displayText: Everything exists simultaneously, and the past, present, and future
      are all visible at the same time, flickering like a corrupted save file.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2200000022000000300000003000000039000000390000006600000066000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: A blank mirror stood in the center of the room.
    displayText: A blank mirror stood in the center of the room.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika, $$let's inspect each fragments and reassemble the whole picture.
      $$And then, $$the choice is yours.
    displayText: Rika, let's inspect each fragments and reassemble the whole picture.
      And then, the choice is yours.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 060000000600000045000000450000004f0000004f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: .$.$.It's ours.
    displayText: ...It's ours.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0100000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Yeah.$.$.
    displayText: Yeah...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.036
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
